<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Oct current account data due Thursday.</title>
<headline>Brazil Oct current account data due Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank will reveal current account and foreign reserve data for October at 1100 local time/1300 GMT Thursday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said monetary base results for October and public sector debt figures for September would be announced next Tuesday, also at 1100 local time/1300 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
